/*
 * Implements the rewriting phase of the Ymir macro system.
 *
 * MacroRewriting is responsible for transforming a macro-generated string
 * into its final expanded form. It processes the rewritten content produced
 * by MacroSolving and applies:
 *
 *   - embedded macro evaluations(`#{ ... }`, `#( ... )`, `#[ ... ]`),
 *   - macro `for` loops(`#{ for x in expr { ... } }`),
 *   - nested rewriting of blocks,
 *   - mapper-based substitution of captured macro variables,
 *   - trimming and indentation handling.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::macro_::rewrite
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/macro_/rewrite.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2024-09-11
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
